      "entries": [
        "60 feet, DC 45. A creature entering or starting its turn in the aura that fails at a Fortitude save becomes doomed|CRB|doomed 1 and drained|CRB|drained 1. If the target was already doomed or drained, the values of these conditions increase by 1, to a maximum of doomed|CRB|doomed 3 and drained|CRB|drained 3. A creature that dies while doomed|CRB|doomed 3 and drained|CRB|drained 3 in this way disintegrates into black sand."
