      "traits": [
        "necromancy",
        "occult"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "Unlike most undead, Iffdahsil isn't destroyed at 0 HP. Iffdahsil's fast healing continues to function normally, though on any round it begins its turn at 0 HP, it is enfeebled|CRB|enfeebled 4 and slowed|CRB|slowed 1 until the start of its next turn. While Iffdahsil is at 0 HP, it can be killed permanently only by simultaneously exposing it to direct sunlight (or a 10th-level sunburst spell) and casting a miracle or wish spell (or similar magic) directed at destroying it."
      ]
